working baseline robot with gz integration

Added a new package wich defines a diff drive robot from scratch, has separate launch files for:
- launching gz with a custom world
- spawning the robot in gz
- bridging the gz /cmd_vel and /odom topics from the diffdrive plugin with ROS

Result:
we can control the diff drive robot from ros via /cmd_vel and obtain odometry via /odom. 

The whole system launches with simulation.launch.py